{
 "title": "Trance Gate",
 "children": [
  {
   "title": "Overview",
   "lines": [
    "Tempo-locked step",
    "gate with a per-step",
    "ADSR.",
    "",
    "The ring is the",
    "pattern. Filled arcs",
    "are steps that",
    "sound, hollow ones",
    "are gaps.",
    "",
    "Thickness is the",
    "step's Amount.",
    "",
    "A dot inside the",
    "ring is the",
    "playhead. A bracket",
    "outside it is the",
    "step you are",
    "editing.",
    "",
    "While the fade is",
    "part way in, a step",
    "that has not arrived",
    "is a HOLLOW arc."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Pads",
   "lines": [
    "One pad per step,",
    "from the top left.",
    "",
    "Green: the step",
    " sounds.",
    "Red: it is a gap.",
    "",
    "BRIGHTNESS is that",
    "step's Amount. A",
    "quiet step is a",
    "dimmer pad; it never",
    "goes below about",
    "half, so an on step",
    "always reads as on.",
    "",
    "The SELECTED step is",
    "one shade lighter",
    "than the same step",
    "would be otherwise.",
    "",
    "A press toggles the",
    "step AND selects it.",
    "SHIFT + press sets a",
    "tie: it holds",
    "through the next",
    "step without",
    "retriggering.",
    "",
    "Dark: past the end",
    " of the pattern."
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Controls",
   "children": [
    {
     "title": "Gate Page",
     "lines": [
      "Knob 1: Len",
      " Steps in the",
      "  pattern, 1-32.",
      "",
      "Knob 2: Rate",
      " Length of one step.",
      "",
      "Knob 3: All Amount",
      " Dry/wet for the",
      " WHOLE effect.",
      " 0% is a bypass.",
      "",
      " Shown as the bar",
      " down the right",
      " hand side.",
      "",
      "Knobs 4-7:",
      " Attack, Decay,",
      " Sustain, Release.",
      "",
      "Knob 8: Step Amount",
      " How loud THIS step",
      " is. 0% is silent.",
      " Pick the step with",
      " a pad first."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Settings Page",
     "lines": [
      "Attack, Decay,",
      "Sustain, Release",
      "shape every step.",
      "",
      "Gate is how much of",
      "a step stays open",
      "before releasing.",
      "",
      "All Amount is the",
      "dry/wet for the",
      "WHOLE effect. At 0%",
      "the gate is bypassed",
      "and everything",
      "passes through.",
      "",
      "Step Amount (on the",
      "wheel page) is one",
      "step's level. Same",
      "idea, smaller scope.",
      "",
      "Slot picks one of 8",
      "patterns.",
      "",
      "With the transport",
      "stopped the gate",
      "holds open and the",
      "audio passes."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Fade In",
     "lines": [
      "Introduces the steps",
      "ONE AT A TIME.",
      "",
      "Knob: Fade",
      " 0% no step sounds.",
      " 100% all of them.",
      " The arrivals in",
      " between are evenly",
      " spaced.",
      "",
      "Knob: Shape",
      " Soft ramps a step",
      " in on its own",
      " level. Hard jumps",
      " it on.",
      "",
      "The ORDER they",
      "arrive in travels",
      "with the patch. Edit",
      "it in the Live",
      "plugin; a build-up",
      "sequenced there",
      "plays back here."
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Random",
     "lines": [
      "Knob: Rnd",
      " Turn to Roll for a",
      " new pattern and a",
      " new arrival order.",
      " Turn back to Hold.",
      "",
      "Hits are spread",
      "evenly and one",
      "always lands on the",
      "downbeat, so the",
      "result is a gate",
      "rather than noise.",
      "",
      "Ties are cleared and",
      "levels return to",
      "full.",
      "",
      "It does NOT move the",
      "playhead, so it is",
      "safe mid-bar."
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Timing",
   "lines": [
    "The gate follows",
    "song position, so",
    "it stays bar-aligned",
    "however long it runs",
    "and survives a seek.",
    "",
    "Rate is one step's",
    "length. At 1/16 a",
    "16-step pattern is",
    "one bar.",
    "",
    "Times are in ms and",
    "are NOT synced: a",
    "1/16 step is",
    "15000/BPM ms, so 125",
    "ms at 120. Keep",
    "Attack plus Decay",
    "under that or a step",
    "never reaches full."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
